The repository must be a single collection root, without duplicate nested `plugins/` directories.

Once installed into the AAP Execution Environment, enable the callback through `ansible.cfg`:

```ini
[defaults]
callbacks_enabled = company.observability.zabbix_kpi
```

No additional reporting tasks or roles should be required in individual playbooks.

Ensure the configuration files are packaged and resolved correctly inside the Execution Environment. Do not assume that files in a playbook repository are automatically accessible to a callback installed elsewhere.

